# convention. pin-root.sh exports MISSION_WORKDIR=<pinned worktree> and re-execs;
# the driver sets REPO from it at line 40 (correct), but THIS file is re-sourced at
# line 47 and clobbered it back — so the "driver pin:" log line named the stale
# source clone while the loop actually ran the pinned worktree. Behaviour was right,
# the provenance line was the opposite of the truth. Now the pin wins.
MISSION_WORKDIR="${MISSION_WORKDIR:-/Users/voightkampff/dev/sunholo-data/ailang-world}"
# Quota plan (updated 2026-07-27): executor now defaults to codex:gpt-5.6-sol in the
# shared driver (ChatGPT-subscription lane w/ opus fallback pre-flight). Designer/evaluator
