# --- PATH fix (iter-23, 2026-07-27) ------------------------------------------
# The World launchd plist (~/Library/LaunchAgents/dev.ailang.mission-world.plist) sets NO
# EnvironmentVariables PATH, unlike the V1 plist which supplies
# /opt/homebrew/bin. The shared driver's line 44 only PREPENDS
# ($HOME/go/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH), so on this mission $PATH stays homebrew-less and
# `codex`, `gh`, `go`, `node` all resolve rc=127 -> the codex pre-flight (line 297) false-
# negatives and demotes the RATIFIED codex:gpt-5.6-sol pin to opus EVERY fire.
# Iters 18/19/21/22 each mis-attributed this to the shared driver / a spent quota / an
# unusable pin; mission-v1 refuted that (its plist DOES carry the path, its codex lane fires)
# and iter-23 confirmed it first-party: `grep -c PATH` on the World plist == 0.
# The driver is FROZEN CORE and this file is sourced at line 48 (AFTER 44, BEFORE the probe),
# so the per-mission env file is the correct, non-frozen home for the fix.
PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin:$PATH

